## 🟢 Step 3 – Pro/Interview Approach (Dummy Node)
- Use a `dummy` node so you don’t have to worry about “first node special case”.  
- Always attach nodes to `tail->next`.  
- Finally return `dummy.next`.  

(Already shared earlier, that’s the **gold standard**.)

